[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3061487355","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108501#issuecomment-3061487355","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108501","id":3061487355,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc62epb7","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-11T09:25:51Z","updated_at":"2025-07-11T11:25:16Z","body":"You can't override the `rpc` method, see [the documentation](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.html#inheritance)\n\nThis seems to be a bug in the parser though it should error on that rather than the format, but the thing you're attempting to do is not supported ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3061487355/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"resolved"}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3061800121","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108501#issuecomment-3061800121","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108501","id":3061800121,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc62f1y5","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-11T10:58:45Z","updated_at":"2025-07-11T10:58:45Z","body":"This is not a bug, but a fix for an old incorrect behavior (except that overriding non-virtual native methods is not supported).\n\nPreviously, GDScript did not know about the existence of a variadic parameter, so you could use a finite number of optional parameters in an \"overriding\" method, and this was considered a compatible signature. But this is incorrect: if you, say, declare a function with 10 parameters and pass 11, you will get an error.\n\nThe signature compatibility rule (ignoring types and contravariance): `min_argc <= parent_min_argc <= parent_max_argc <= max_argc`. That is, the range of the argument count of the overriding method must include the range of the argument count of the overridden method, so that the Liskov substitution principle is fulfilled. In case the parent method is variadic (`parent_max_argc == INT_MAX`), the child method must also be variadic.\n\nSo the following code will work:\n\n```gdscript\n@warning_ignore(\"native_method_override\")\nfunc rpc(method: StringName, ...args: Array) -> Error:\n    return OK\n```\n\n@MikeSchulze [reported](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/7496#issuecomment-2992882652) this issue earlier. But since the previous behavior was incorrect and overriding non-virtual native methods is not supported, I think this should not be considered a bug, regression, or even a compatibility break. It matters to testing framework authors, but regular users are unlikely to encounter it, so it probably doesn't even deserve a mention in a 4.5 migration guide.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3061800121/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3061912178","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108501#issuecomment-3061912178","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108501","id":3061912178,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc62gRJy","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-11T11:29:55Z","updated_at":"2025-07-11T11:29:55Z","body":"Missed that the warning was shown, so there's no broken behavior as such here","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3061912178/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3067186671","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108501#issuecomment-3067186671","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108501","id":3067186671,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc620Y3v","user":{"login":"bitwes","id":1156520,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNTY1MjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1156520?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitwes","html_url":"https://github.com/bitwes","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitwes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitwes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitwes/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitwes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitwes/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitwes/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitwes/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitwes/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitwes/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-13T17:37:06Z","updated_at":"2025-07-13T17:37:06Z","body":"I was unable to find any documentation on the new variadic parameter syntax, therefore I thought I needed to override using a finite number of parameters.  It appears I can use this new syntax override functions with variadic parameters and therefore avoid any requirement to violate the Liskov substitution principle.\n\n> It matters to testing framework authors, but regular users are unlikely to encounter it.\n\nWith all due respeect, it matters to testing framework __users__.  I only care that you can do this because a [user requested it](https://github.com/bitwes/Gut/issues/246), and my users are inherently your users.\n\n> doesn't even deserve a mention in a 4.5 migration guide.\n\nAs long as the new variadic parameter syntax is mentioned, I'd agree.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3067186671/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]